A byte-identical copy of the buffering-quality conformance vectors; do not
hand-edit it. The spec is docs/design/2026-10-17-buffering-quality.md in the
same repository, and the server repo owns both files. A case that seems to
contradict the spec is a spec bug: fix it there and re-vendor, never patch this
copy. BufferingQualityVectorsTest replays every controller case against
BufferingQualityController on a virtual clock, and BandwidthProbeVectorsTest
replays probe_cases against the speed test's window arithmetic.
connection_budget_cases are server-only.
